<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44809" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔ-πνοος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, 
			contr.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔ-πνους</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ουν</span>, 
			Ep.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐΰπνοος</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πνέω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>breathing
				well</i> or <i>freely</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Prog.</u>
				15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Epid.</u>
				4.26
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			), <i><span class="en">
				Max.Tyr.
				30.6
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄϋπνος</span>
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> causal,
				<i>making one breathe freely, relieving oppression of the
				breath</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λουτρόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Acut.</u>
					66
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>sweet-smelling</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λείρια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Mosch.
					2.32
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥόδον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					14.2040.3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>affording a free passage to the air</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυκτῆρες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					1.10
				</span></i>
			 (
				Comp.
			); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ [περὶ τὴν κεφαλὴν] τόπος
				εὔ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				653b2
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				673b23
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάλαμοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Longus
					2.35
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεφέλαι εὔ. αὔραις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>H.</u>
					21.6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>open to the winds, airy</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκία εὔπνους μὲν τοῦ θέρους,
					εὐήλιος δὲ τοῦ χειμῶνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					1345a31
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόποι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					869a34
				</span></i>
			 (
				Comp.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δένδρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>CP</u>
					1.15.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ εὔ. τοῦ τόπου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phdr.</u>
					230c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>good to breathe, fresh and pure</i>, of the air, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				1.13.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				3.2.13
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐπνοώτερος</span> X.l.c., <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				4.26
			</span></i>; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐπνούστερος</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				7.39
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				960b22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				5.911
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			 -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ούστατος</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				673b23
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
